      "summary": "The California Institute of Integral Studies (CIIS) has unveiled a new strategic plan, 'Building On Commitment: CIIS @ 60,' covering the period from 2022 to 2028. The plan, crafted with extensive community input, centers around goals such as reimagining the university's core identity, achieving sustainability, gaining recognition for diversity, equity, and inclusion efforts, and fostering innovation in research and community life. CIIS aims to continue being a hub for academic rigor and personal growth by embedding spirituality and improving community well-being, ensuring a meaningful impact on society and the world.",
